            checker that rewards what its own rule forbids is worse than ∄
            checker. It now resolves through instance.vsm, and a URL is not
            checked as a path (R10: a gate does not reach the network).",
      real_defects_this_surfaced: "3, all invisible before:
              covenant @ref COVENANT_FLOW.vsm — target does not exist
