      // reference to delete, ¬a document to invent.
      // With it gone the WHOLE corpus parses --strict VALID — 48/48.
      // Rides with COVENANT-STATUS-DEFERRED; ¬a separate pass.
    },

    authoring_latency_closed: {
      was: "the loop closed at COMMIT — the latest possible moment. An agent
            wrote a whole document, then learned it carried eleven defects,
            and paid to rewrite what it had already paid to write.",
      now: "TWO layers, and the first matters more.
            PREVENTION — most of those eleven existed because vsl_language was
              NARROWER THAN ITS OWN CANON. An author reading the grammar could
