              --strict from 13/40 to 1/48. ∄ amount of fast feedback
              substitutes for an error you cannot express.
            IMMEDIACY — scripts/vsl/check.py runs every applicable component
              on ONE file, and a PostToolUse hook fires it the moment a .vsm
              under spec_revision is written. Advisory at write time (a
              half-written document is legitimately mid-flight), blocking at
              commit. It marks which findings are YOURS and which belong to
              the corpus, rather than making the reader guess.",
      // GATE-AT-AUTHORING-TIME — CLOSED 2026-08-09.
    },

