    // rmw3's framing, and the sharper half is the second clause: "una prueba
    // de benchmark puede ser util ya sea para evaluar la herramienta, como
    // para probar la de nosotros mismos". A second implementation of the same
    // rule is a DIFFERENTIAL TEST — where two disagree, one is wrong, and
    // neither gets the benefit of the doubt.
    // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    benchmark_pydantic: {
      question: "does a declarative model validate the debt register better
