      // already found ONE fuse that LOST TEXT (s3star_audit's `method:`
      // field, truncated at fuse time, invisible for two days). That was
      // found by accident, by a structure gate looking for something else.
      // ∄ pass has looked for the class deliberately.

      // HOOK-MEASURES-AFTER-WRITING — CLOSED 2026-08-10.
      // .claude/hooks/vsl-measure-before-write, PreToolUse on Write|Edit:
      // it puts the file's CURRENT state — parse, balance, declarations —
      // in front of the agent BEFORE the edit. Advisory; its job is that the
